the resolved taxonomy `identifier_schemes.spec_id.pattern`: identifier integrity: and `identifier_schemes.section_id.pattern` admit one string, so two records could carry one identifier. `spec_id` is in namespace `ZED-SPECIFICATION`, and kinds `specification`, `appendix` mint under it. `section_id` is in namespace `ZED`, and kind `section` mints under it
the resolved taxonomy `identifier_schemes.wrapped_id.pattern`: identifier integrity: and `identifier_schemes.plain_id.pattern` admit one string, so two records could carry one identifier. `wrapped_id` is in namespace `Y`, and no kind mints under it. `plain_id` is in namespace `X`, and no kind mints under it
